---
// Post 20 (Alpha) figure: gp. Inline SVG, site tokens only. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp20-gp">
  <div class="atp20-gp-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 320" role="img" aria-label="Four small trees. Parent A is rank of a five-day change in close. Parent B is high minus low. Crossover puts parent B subtree under rank. Mutation then replaces low with open.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Crossover swaps a subtree; mutation changes one symbol</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lai ghép đổi một nhánh; đột biến đổi một ký hiệu</tspan></text>
<text x="110" y="62" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Parent A</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bố A</tspan></text>
<text x="340" y="62" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Parent B</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mẹ B</tspan></text>
<text x="570" y="62" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Child (crossover)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Con (lai ghép)</tspan></text>
<text x="790" y="62" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>After mutation</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sau đột biến</tspan></text>
<line x1="110" y1="100" x2="110" y2="160" class="ln" />
<line x1="110" y1="160" x2="110" y2="205" class="ln" />
<circle cx="110" cy="100" r="19" class="node" />
<text x="110" y="105" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">rank</text>
<rect x="70" y="145" width="80" height="30" rx="15" class="nodeg" />
<text x="110" y="165" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">delta5</text>
<rect x="73" y="205" width="74" height="30" rx="6" class="leaf" />
<text x="110" y="225" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">close</text>
<line x1="340" y1="150" x2="300" y2="225" class="ln" />
<line x1="340" y1="150" x2="380" y2="225" class="ln" />
<rect x="300" y="132" width="80" height="36" rx="18" class="nodeg" />
<text x="340" y="156" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">−</text>
<rect x="267" y="225" width="66" height="30" rx="6" class="leaf" />
<text x="300" y="245" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">high</text>
<rect x="347" y="225" width="66" height="30" rx="6" class="leaf" />
<text x="380" y="245" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">low</text>
<line x1="570" y1="100" x2="570" y2="150" class="ln" />
<line x1="570" y1="150" x2="530" y2="225" class="ln" />
<line x1="570" y1="150" x2="610" y2="225" class="ln" />
<circle cx="570" cy="100" r="19" class="node" />
<text x="570" y="105" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">rank</text>
<rect x="530" y="132" width="80" height="36" rx="18" class="nodeg" />
<text x="570" y="156" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">−</text>
<rect x="497" y="225" width="66" height="30" rx="6" class="leaf" />
<text x="530" y="245" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">high</text>
<rect x="577" y="225" width="66" height="30" rx="6" class="leaf" />
<text x="610" y="245" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">low</text>
<line x1="790" y1="100" x2="790" y2="150" class="ln" />
<line x1="790" y1="150" x2="750" y2="225" class="ln" />
<line x1="790" y1="150" x2="830" y2="225" class="ln" />
<circle cx="790" cy="100" r="19" class="node" />
<text x="790" y="105" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">rank</text>
<circle cx="790" cy="150" r="19" class="node" />
<text x="790" y="155" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">−</text>
<rect x="717" y="225" width="66" height="30" rx="6" class="leaf" />
<text x="750" y="245" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">high</text>
<rect x="797" y="225" width="66" height="30" rx="6" class="noder" />
<text x="830" y="245" class="mono" text-anchor="middle">open</text>
<line x1="415" y1="150" x2="482.0" y2="150.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="490,150 482.0,146.0 482.0,154.0" class="arrf" />
<text x="452" y="118" class="xs" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>graft B’s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghép nhánh</tspan></text>
<text x="452" y="134" class="xs" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>branch in</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>của B vào</tspan></text>
<line x1="640" y1="150" x2="692.0" y2="150.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="700,150 692.0,146.0 692.0,154.0" class="arrf" />
<text x="670" y="140" class="xs" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>one leaf</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một lá</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="300" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Gold = the part that moved. Red = the symbol that was changed. The child is scored like any other formula.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vàng = phần được chuyển. Đỏ = ký hiệu bị đổi. Con được chấm điểm như mọi công thức khác.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Two operations are enough to move a population around the space: swap branches between good formulas, and now and then change one symbol.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Hai phép là đủ để dịch chuyển cả quần thể: đổi nhánh giữa các công thức tốt, và thỉnh thoảng đổi một ký hiệu.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp20-gp { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp20-gp-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp20-gp svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp20-gp text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp20-gp .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-gp .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-gp .xs { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-gp .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-gp .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-gp .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-gp .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-gp .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp20-gp .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-gp .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-gp .node { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-gp .leaf { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-gp .nodeg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-gp .noder { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-gp .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .atp20-gp .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-gp .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-gp .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-gp .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-gp .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-gp .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-gp .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp20-gp .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp20-gp .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp20-gp .tick { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .atp20-gp figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>